   "num": "01",
   "kind": "short",
   "intro": "<p>A student investigated the effect of sowing density on the growth of mustard seedlings. She put filter paper in five Petri dishes, added the same volume of water to each, and sowed 10, 20, 30, 40 or 50 seeds in one dish for each density. The dishes were kept in a dark cupboard at 20 °C. After 7 days she measured the shoot length of every seedling. Table 1 shows her results.</p><figure><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%\"><table class=\"tbl\"><caption>Table 1</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">Seeds per dish</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">10</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">20</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">30</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">40</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">50</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">Mean shoot length / mm</th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">52</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">50</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">44</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">37</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">31</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">Standard deviation / mm</th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">6</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">7</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">6</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">8</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">9</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figcaption class=\"small\">Hypothetical data. One dish at each density.</figcaption></figure>",
