   "intro": "<p>A small insect-eating bird lives all year round in the hedges around farmland. Each spring, the same two observers walked the same route through one area of farmland on the same dates and counted the breeding pairs. Table 2 shows the counts and the number of days with snow cover in the winter before each count.</p><figure><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%\"><table class=\"tbl\"><caption>Table 2</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">Year</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">1</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">2</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">3</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">4</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">5</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">6</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">7</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">8</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">Days with snow cover in the winter before the count</th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">2</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">0</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">14</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">3</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">1</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">21</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">5</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">0</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:#061814;background:#e8efec;padding:.3rem .4rem\">Number of breeding pairs</th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">410</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">445</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">260</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">300</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">360</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">150</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">190</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem;color:#061814\">255</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figcaption class=\"small\">Hypothetical data.</figcaption></figure>",
